ut... There are almost 20 of them..."}]},{"spans":[{"text":"Shouldn't we be trying to save money now?"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Sakura","expression":2,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{"spritePosition":"0,-270","spriteScale":"1.27"}}],"ops":[{"type":"darken","raw":"同时置暗"},{"type":"fadePointOn","raw":"黑点1"}],"speaker":"Commander","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"You should print them, print them all! Even if it means having to pawn everything we have for it!"}]}]}]}
